:HELP NAME='HLDSPLF/SELECT'.Select files for (SELECT)
:P.The select files for for this command.
:P.The value has 5 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. User
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*CURRENT:EPK.
