:HELP NAME='WRKSPLFA/SPLNBR'.Spooled file number (SPLNBR)
:P.The number of the spooled file among the job's spooled files of the
same name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ONLY:EPK.
:PD.The only one&colon. an error is sent when more than one matches.
:PT.:PK.*LAST:EPK.
:PD.The last one.
