:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 999999.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSPLFA/JOBSYSNAME'.Job system name (JOBSYSNAME)
:P.The name of the system the job ran on, which tells apart spooled
